# A96 probe (kernel desktop, sd-probe = sd-base + C:\A96ZOMB.NAP, no #Z):
# park bottom-right, dump the idle desktop (A: 25 items, folders first, then
# A96ZOMB.NAP as the first file at (94,146)); double-click it -> run_gem_app launches the probe, which
# opens "A96 ZOMBIE" at (120,80,300,200) and stands 3 s (B, 2 s after the
# click); then it Pterm's without closing -> desktop_resume (C, 5 s after the
# click; D, 2 s later). Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up".
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 94 146
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
1800 parkbr
2000 mark B_PROBE_WINDOW
2600 mark C_DESK_BACK
3000 mark D_DESK_BACK_2S
